          %h2#references References
          %p The fact that the homotopy coherent nerve if a locally fibrant operad is inner Kan is shown in section 7 of
          %ul#MoerdijkWeiss
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ieke+Moerdijk"}> Ieke Moerdijk
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ittay+Weiss"} Ittay Weiss
              = succeed "," do
                %em On inner Kan complexes in the category of dendroidal sets
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0701295"} math.CT/0701295
          %p The Quillen adjunction properties of the homotopy coherent dendroidal nerve are discussed in section 4 of
          %ul#CisinskiMoerdijk
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Denis-Charles+Cisinski"}> Denis-Charles Cisinski
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ieke+Moerdijk"} Ieke Moerdijk
              %em Dendroidal sets and simplicial operads
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1109.1004"}> arXiv:1109.1004
              )
          %p Lecture notes on these two topics are in section 6 and 9 of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ieke+Moerdijk"}> Ieke Moerdijk
              ,
              %em Lectures on dendroidal sets
              , lectures given at the Barcelona workshop on
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://www.crm.es/HigherCategories/"} Simplicial methods in higher categories
              (2008) (
              %a{:href => "http://www.crm.cat/HigherCategories/hc1.pdf"}> preliminary writeup
              )
